        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. Between April 20 and May 5, the Personnel Department shall concentrate upon assignment of teachers being transferred for involuntary reasons. No person shall be transferred or hired in an area of specialization or certification until the displaced teacher in said area is assigned.",
