        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "11. By May 20, hiring of new teachers for the coming school year may begin. This shall not be interpreted as foreclosing further arrangements relating to assignments of teachers seeking voluntary transfers and as stated in Section J below.",
